WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.038
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.112
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:13.621
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.621 --> 00:00:15.289
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:19.082
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:23.850
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents.
